TypeScript 7: wait for @typescript-eslint/parser and related packages to support TypeScript 7.
Widget ESLint 10: wait for eslint-plugin-react to add ESLint 10 support.
The upgrades should then be straightforward:

pnpm update typescript @typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin @typescript-eslint/parser --latest --recursive
pnpm update eslint @eslint/js eslint-plugin-react --latest --recursive
pnpm install
pnpm peers check
pnpm build
pnpm lint


Until then, the current versions are the newest compatible choices for this project.


